# Exam Readiness Tutor final code quality audit

When working in `D:\projects\exam-readness-tuttor`, use the Codex skill
`exam-readness-code-quality` before completing the following work:

Use this rule for:

- code quality review, standards compliance, or pre-merge QA
- substantive Python changes
- dependency changes in `pyproject.toml` or `uv.lock`
- project structure, configuration, testing, security, or logging changes

The skill loads the project scope, standards, opt-out cases, and validation
commands, then applies the shared quality method and report. For other
repositories this rule does not apply.
